# Apply the guard even to the synthetic operator; refusal and spectator control use the real hook.
wait 1
cmd gamemode creative Tester
cmd tp @s 40 150 40
expect Moderators can only teleport in spectator mode
cmd spec
expect return point has been saved
wait 1
cmd tp @s 40 150 40
expect-pos 40 150 40 2
cmd norm
expect Returned to
wait 1
expect-none panicked
